    "element_type" : "text_block",
    "page_number" : 1,
    "bounding_box" : null,
    "text" : "2. We assume the concentration of [HA]<sub>eqm</sub> is the same as [HA]<sub>initial</sub>, since the degree of dissociation is very small. In other words we say the dissociation of [HA] is negligible or so small it can be ignored.",
